+        // LOCAL FIX (ik-llama-toolkit), RESULTS 49.11. build_deepseek4 names its
+        // SWA window cut "dsv4_raw_mask_window_cpu" when the cut is a view of the
+        // host-side mask input and the u-batch is large enough to be worth it
